  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is morning at school. Lily has a new pink dress. Lily and Mia see Leo at the door. Leo has funny clothes. He has a white shirt and a green jacket. His socks are yellow. Mia looks at his boots. \"One boot is black,\" says Mia. \"One boot is blue!\" \"Leo, what is that?\" asks Lily.",
      "Leo looks sad. \"I have two black boots,\" he says. \"But I can not find one.\" \"So I wear a blue boot.\" Lily looks at the boots. \"They are funny,\" she says. \"Are you sad, Leo?\" asks Mia. \"Yes, I am,\" says Leo. \"The children look at me.\"",
      "Teacher Kim comes to the door. \"Good morning, Leo,\" she says. \"I like your boots.\" \"One black, one blue. They are very nice!\" Leo smiles. \"I like blue and black too,\" says Lily. \"Me too!\" says Mia. \"Thank you,\" says Leo. Now he is happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Leo comes to school with one black boot and one blue boot. He is sad, but Teacher Kim and his friends like his boots.",
